<title>INDONESIA: Lippo sees &quot;satisfying&quot; 1996 net.</title>
<headline>Lippo sees &quot;satisfying&quot; 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian brokerage firm PT Lippo Securities said on Thursday it expected a &quot;satisfying&quot; 1996 net profit.</p>
<p>Shares of Lippo Securities have made strong gains in active trading in the past several days on market talk of possible higher-than-expected 1996 financial results.</p>
<p>Lippo was up 100 rupiah to 2,325 rupiah, with around three million shares traded after two hours of trading on Thursday. This compared with a closing price of 2,075 rupiah last Friday.</p>
